codex
The Lean failure is now isolated: this audit sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but hides `/proc/<current-pid>/exe`; Lean 4 reads the latter to locate its installation. I’m applying a narrow read-only compatibility shim that redirects only the current process’s `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, then I’ll rerun the required checker and clean builds under the pinned toolchain.
